  "body": [
    "Meet the Atelier",
    "A machine that pays attention. It senses every cup, learns what you love, reads the shape of your morning, and pours accordingly — no dials, no guesswork.",
    "From $2,199, or $184/mo. Free delivery, expert setup, and a two-year guarantee.",
    "Ritual, meet intelligence",
    "A cup or two in, it starts to memorise your taste. Soon the first pour of the day simply arrives the way you like it.",
    "A slow Sunday and a full calendar call for different cups. The Atelier adjusts to the shape of your day.",
    "It reorders beans before you run out and sends the grounds back to soil. Care, right down to the last cup.",
    "How it actually works",
    "Not a preset menu, and not a guess. The Atelier works the way a good barista does — it pays attention, remembers, and adjusts. Four quiet steps, running every morning.",
    "Sensors read the grind, the flow, the strength and the temperature of every pour — the same things a barista would notice.",
    "Those readings become a profile for each person in the house, refined a little more with every cup you pour.",
    "The time, your calendar, the weather, and who's awake all shape what it suggests — before you've asked for anything.",
    "It warms up before your alarm, adjusts the pour to match, and reorders beans before you run low. You just lift the cup.",
    "Your flavour DNA and morning routines stay on your machine and your account. You can review what it has learned, correct it, or wipe it clean, any time.",
    "How it learns you",
    "We call the picture the Atelier builds your flavour DNA. Watch it shift as the day, and your mood, changes.",
    "Brisk and a little bolder. Enough to meet the day, never so much it rushes you.",
    "See it in the morning",
    "A short film is in production. Drop your own reel in here when it's ready.",
    "It simply knew what I wanted, before I did.",
    "Priya — three weeks with the Atelier",
    "What owners say",
    "from 214 verified owners",
    "It simply knew what I wanted, before I did. The first machine I've owned that got better the longer I had it.",
    "I was sceptical at the price. Then it started reordering beans before I noticed, and warming up before my alarm. Now the counter feels bare without it.",
    "Every person in our house gets their own cup, exactly right, without touching a single dial. Worth every penny.",
    "In the details",
    "Learns your taste",
    "Reorders itself",
    "Compostable pods",
    "Whisper-quiet grind",
    "Two-year guarantee",
    "Ways to buy",
    "The machine, delivered and set up in your kitchen. Everything it needs to start learning you.",
    "The machine, plus house beans delivered as you need them for a year. It reorders; you never run dry.",
    "Adds the milk jug, tamper, and two ceramic cups — for the mornings you want to do it by hand.",
    "Bring the Atelier home.",
    "From $2,199, or $184/mo for 12 months. Free delivery, expert setup, and a two-year workshop guarantee.",
    "Warm mornings, made effortless. Coffee, tea, and cold-pressed juice, and the machines that make them sing.",
    "© 2026 Fréscopa · Privacy · Terms · A fictional brand, created for demonstration."
  ],
